 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/08/23 00:00| 01 | 276| 018| 1058| 0161| 0672| 1197|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/08/22 08:24| 01 | 342| 010| 0440| 0050| 0367| 0488|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/08/22 06:24| 03 | 276| 026| 0744| 0172| 0525| 1076|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/08/22 03:24| 01 | 064| 014| 0499| 0190| 0376| 0845|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/08/21 18:48| 01 | 343| 008| 0459| 0576| 0332| 1646|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/08/21 17:12| 03 | 335| 016| 029"
